      "note": "Two causes stacked, and the segmentation one comes first: a fence touching a paragraph with no blank line between them is already outside §5.4's agreement subset, so the tree splits where blank-line segmentation joins. On top of that §3.3 judges the crossing marker by the line it OPENS on, which is outside the fence, so the string core reads it as a marker and removing it takes the listing bytes its span covers.",
